  "content": "\n\n<h1>跳躍附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fleaping-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/leaping-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<p>「跳躍」是一款專為靴子設計的全新附魔，共有三個等級，能有效提升你的跳躍能力！</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品寶箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot leaping_enchantment:<level></code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s leaping_enchantment:leaping <level></code></pre>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤與問題回報</h2>\n<p>請於 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題或漏洞。</p>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往 PayPal 贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器架設</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個相當耗時、繁瑣且成本高昂的過程。</p>\n<p>但使用 BisectHosting，只需輕點幾下即可擁有專屬伺服器！他們提供全天候客服與快速回應機制，確保你不會遇到任何阻礙！感興趣嗎？我們特別為你準備了優惠方案！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器架設